# Rust build artifacts
/target
**/target

# Captured HTTP archives.
#
# The .har files under docs/ are real browser captures of authenticated
# sessions against brioeducation.ca and monportail.ulaval.ca. They contain
# live Authorization headers, session cookies, OAuth access/refresh/id
# tokens, and personal data belonging to third-party users.
#
# They are deliberately untracked. Do not commit them: git history would
# retain the credentials even after a later deletion. Keep them local, or
# commit only a redacted/sanitised extract.
docs/*.har

# Local environment and credentials
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
secrets.toml

# Editor / OS noise
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
